OL,3,GNEWSAWilliam and Kate meet young people
OL,4,Aduring Belfast visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales are
OL,7,Fmaking their seventh joint visit to
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,10,FFirst stop for William and Catherine
OL,11,Fwas a former church on Belfast's Ormeau
OL,12,FRoad, The Commons, which has been
OL,13,Ftransformed into a community centre.
OL,15,FThe royal couple met employers,
OL,16,Ffrontline organisations and young
OL,17,Fpeople involved in the New Employment
OL,18,FOpportunities Network (NEON).
OL,20,FIt is part of the Homewards project
OL,21,Fwhich works to try to end homelessness.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
